{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Gina, you won't believe it - I got mentored by this amazing business dude yesterday! It was really inspiring and now I'm even more pumped to chase my dreams. What's been up with you lately?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-d19da91e77303d5a1807310f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:07.176347+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d19da91e77303d5a1807310f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d19da91e77303d5a1807310f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow, Jon! Mentors can really help. I'm working on my online store, growing the customer base. It's tough but I'm determined. How about you? Any new things happening?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-b42aede9978b8d18cf108017", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:11.281992+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b42aede9978b8d18cf108017", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b42aede9978b8d18cf108017", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Been doing some promotion for my business. Crazy ride so far, but I'm hanging in there. Got any tips for marketing?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-1d8a4483b7b01d14cbd2fdf4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:15.359276+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1d8a4483b7b01d14cbd2fdf4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1d8a4483b7b01d14cbd2fdf4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Awesome! Marketing is key. Use social media channels and work with influencers for bigger reach."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-8af26a74c425a0a38fea7dc2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:19.440517+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8af26a74c425a0a38fea7dc2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8af26a74c425a0a38fea7dc2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks for the advice, Gina! I already started doing what you said about social media and posted some of my dance videos. It's creating a bit of a stir."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-56a7a322cb80a67051667cb3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:23.515356+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "56a7a322cb80a67051667cb3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "56a7a322cb80a67051667cb3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Nice! Glad your dance vids are doing well online. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-9ccf6ee4275e2786a8cbc31e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:27.592079+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9ccf6ee4275e2786a8cbc31e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9ccf6ee4275e2786a8cbc31e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Your help really helps. Hey, have you thought about being an entrepreneur?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-02e3323229f5547aad2e44e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:31.652047+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "02e3323229f5547aad2e44e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "02e3323229f5547aad2e44e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Ha, yeah, Jon. I've been one 'cause I lost my job. I opened an online clothing store and it's been great! Being my own boss and doing something I love is awesome."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-472b3574493cd992e4c46a96", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:35.728008+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "472b3574493cd992e4c46a96", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "472b3574493cd992e4c46a96", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow, Gina! You did great taking that leap. Congrats! Got any advice for someone just starting out?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-42a32b4b7e18fade14bfe6c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:39.821627+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "42a32b4b7e18fade14bfe6c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "42a32b4b7e18fade14bfe6c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks, Jon! It was a huge jump, but totally worth it. My advice: stay passionate, focused and resilient. Challenges will come, but believe in yourself and keep going. And stay open to learning and improving."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-5b66523fd9545f5a118dade0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:43.893452+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5b66523fd9545f5a118dade0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5b66523fd9545f5a118dade0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Appreciate your advice. Gotta stay resilient and focused, that's key!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-f63428a2b9a3501b8a8aed74", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:47.956316+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f63428a2b9a3501b8a8aed74", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f63428a2b9a3501b8a8aed74", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yep Jon, staying resilient and focused is key for any entrepreneur. Keep going and don't give up! You got this!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-99972e8e783b920d6a9d330a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:52.035262+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "99972e8e783b920d6a9d330a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "99972e8e783b920d6a9d330a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! I won't quit, no matter what. Your encouragement really motivates me to keep going."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-ba9fcc2b01b005bb95386b08", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:28:56.107002+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ba9fcc2b01b005bb95386b08", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ba9fcc2b01b005bb95386b08", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Way to go, Jon! Don't quit, remember, failures lead you closer to success. Here's a pic from when I was dancing - it was a tough road, but it was worth it!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-f8bc7b7a00fe6016b603109a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:00.178985+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f8bc7b7a00fe6016b603109a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f8bc7b7a00fe6016b603109a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow, that's an awesome pic! You guys look great and passionate about dancing. Reminds me how much I love performing. Thanks for sharing!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-908e4c1d8c7faf93add3f49a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:04.269630+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "908e4c1d8c7faf93add3f49a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "908e4c1d8c7faf93add3f49a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! I'm glad the pic reminded you of your love for dancing. Keep going after your dreams!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-05a1a47ab21bf02d176bcfb1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:08.355281+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "05a1a47ab21bf02d176bcfb1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "05a1a47ab21bf02d176bcfb1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Sure thing, Gina! Your help means a lot to me. I'm not giving up."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-17eece6f3bd6a6249ca457b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:12.440036+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "17eece6f3bd6a6249ca457b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "17eece6f3bd6a6249ca457b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Go, Jon! I'm here for you. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-dae3ee21e077549e80d71214", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:16.503890+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dae3ee21e077549e80d71214", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dae3ee21e077549e80d71214", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Knowing you've got my back really helps keep me going. I won't let you down!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-30/session_14-b810f1d767fb35570d1d51a6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:20.568802+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b810f1d767fb35570d1d51a6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b810f1d767fb35570d1d51a6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
